{"id":"2149ce014462d47d","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-hasse-minkowski.md","title":"Hasse–Minkowski Property","display":"df-hasse-minkowski — Hasse–Minkowski Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hasse-minkowski","aliases":["58-df-hasse-minkowski"],"display":"df-hasse-minkowski — Hasse–Minkowski Property","depends_on":["[[58-df-quadratic-form]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch01/58-df-ivc.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hasse-minkowski"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hasse-minkowski</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hasse-minkowski — Hasse–Minkowski Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5ce7b24fbc31ae5\" href=\"?note=f5ce7b24fbc31ae5\" title=\"58-df-quadratic-form\">58-df-quadratic-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"37336284b6cfdfa6\" href=\"?note=37336284b6cfdfa6\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-ivc.md\">../batch01/58-df-ivc.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompletionAt}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompletionAt}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasseMinkowski}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasseMinkowski}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumberField}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{NumberField}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,V,K,\\Omega_K,K_\\bullet,V_\\bullet,Q_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(Q,V,K,\\Omega_K,K_\\bullet,V_\\bullet,Q_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span> (global form, its space, places, and chosen local scalar extensions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumberField}_S,\\mathrm{CompletionAt}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NumberField}_S,\\mathrm{CompletionAt}_S\\)</span>, the place set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_K\">\\(\\Omega_K\\)</span>, and the distinguished zero terms of the chosen quadratic-space structures are number-theoretic metapredicates/operations not constructed in the current dependency closure</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S\\)</span> (quadratic-form predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f5ce7b24fbc31ae5\" href=\"?note=f5ce7b24fbc31ae5\" title=\"58-df-quadratic-form\">58-df-quadratic-form</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasseMinkowski}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HasseMinkowski}_S\\)</span> (local–global property defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hasse\\text{-}minkowski}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HasseMinkowski}_S(Q,V,K,\\Omega_K,K_\\bullet,V_\\bullet,Q_\\bullet)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{NumberField}_S(K)\\land\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S(Q,V,K)\\land\n\\exists C_K,C_V,C_Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(K_\\bullet,\\Omega_K,C_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(V_\\bullet,\\Omega_K,C_V)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q_\\bullet,\\Omega_K,C_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in\\Omega_K\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CompletionAt}_S(K_\\bullet(v),K,v)\n\\land\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S(Q_\\bullet(v),V_\\bullet(v),K_\\bullet(v))\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left[\\exists x\\in V\\setminus\\{0_V\\}\\;(Q(x)=0_K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in\\Omega_K\\;\\exists x\\in V_\\bullet(v)\\setminus\\{0_{V_\\bullet(v)}\\}\\;\n\\bigl(Q_\\bullet(v)(x)=0_{K_\\bullet(v)}\\bigr)\\right]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hasse\\text{-}minkowski}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HasseMinkowski}_S(Q,V,K,\\Omega_K,K_\\bullet,V_\\bullet,Q_\\bullet)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{NumberField}_S(K)\\land\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S(Q,V,K)\\land\n\\exists C_K,C_V,C_Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(K_\\bullet,\\Omega_K,C_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(V_\\bullet,\\Omega_K,C_V)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q_\\bullet,\\Omega_K,C_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in\\Omega_K\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CompletionAt}_S(K_\\bullet(v),K,v)\n\\land\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S(Q_\\bullet(v),V_\\bullet(v),K_\\bullet(v))\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left[\\exists x\\in V\\setminus\\{0_V\\}\\;(Q(x)=0_K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in\\Omega_K\\;\\exists x\\in V_\\bullet(v)\\setminus\\{0_{V_\\bullet(v)}\\}\\;\n\\bigl(Q_\\bullet(v)(x)=0_{K_\\bullet(v)}\\bigr)\\right]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Hasse–Minkowski theorem states that the displayed property holds for quadratic forms over number fields; this atom defines that property instead of asserting the theorem as a definition.  All local objects are now read from the three supplied families, and none of those functions is assigned the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as codomain.</li>\n<li>The turnstile is marked metatheoretic because number fields, their places/completions and the zero elements hidden by the coarse quadratic-form projection are not constructed by the cited atoms.</li>\n<li>Witt group <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W(K)\">\\(W(K)\\)</span> of quadratic forms modulo hyperbolic planes.</li>\n<li>Signature invariants at real places.</li>\n<li>Hilbert symbol measures local non-degeneracy.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-quadratic-form","status":"resolved","id":"f5ce7b24fbc31ae5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-quadratic-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-ivc.md","status":"resolved","id":"37336284b6cfdfa6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-ivc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-quadratic-form","status":"resolved","id":"f5ce7b24fbc31ae5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S$ (quadratic-form predicate, see [[58-df-quadratic-form]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompletionAt}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasseMinkowski}_S\\subseteq V^{7}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumberField}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"Q,V,K,\\Omega_K,K_\\bullet,V_\\bullet,Q_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumberField}_S,\\mathrm{CompletionAt}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasseMinkowski}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hasse\\text{-}minkowski}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}&\n\\mathrm{HasseMinkowski}_S(Q,V,K,\\Omega_K,K_\\bullet,V_\\bullet,Q_\\bullet)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{NumberField}_S(K)\\land\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S(Q,V,K)\\land\n\\exists C_K,C_V,C_Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(K_\\bullet,\\Omega_K,C_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(V_\\bullet,\\Omega_K,C_V)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q_\\bullet,\\Omega_K,C_Q)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall v\\in\\Omega_K\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CompletionAt}_S(K_\\bullet(v),K,v)\n\\land\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S(Q_\\bullet(v),V_\\bullet(v),K_\\bullet(v))\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\left[\\exists x\\in V\\setminus\\{0_V\\}\\;(Q(x)=0_K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in\\Omega_K\\;\\exists x\\in V_\\bullet(v)\\setminus\\{0_{V_\\bullet(v)}\\}\\;\n\\bigl(Q_\\bullet(v)(x)=0_{K_\\bullet(v)}\\bigr)\\right]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"W(K)","display":false}],"bytes":2744,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-609","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-hasse-minkowski.md|58-df-hasse-minkowski]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["f5ce7b24fbc31ae5","36d7463d215be751","37336284b6cfdfa6"]}